msgid "⟪k:0⟫Wouldn’t you say, son?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫君もそう思うだろう？　"

#: scenario2:scenario2_D464456B_1CBE_4740_ABA9_72C051D28144
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06af60304979a611ce9d445ebc14890f6bc9eeb384c0dce40af321026f2ccc12
