msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫は……、⟪k:3⟫はあ、⟪k:4⟫そう……ですね。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_3A8CFF89_3E95_459A_8AC8_A88B0B6A63BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29244bcdb90116164e00763d276daebd7c23624afea9a09bd71ba99c6a15a5c4
