#: scenario2:scenario2_48688F6C_4A2D_4F6F_8035_0F50B05DBDCA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3dd25e9049e0d0f754e4f5c8eda7454c4f406058fce83533ed87fc728fb2a59
#. default-sha256: 273910bcf070e7f858e76cec57447fd424ccea5d8bd9fe9e5cfe04d1aef17149
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_48688F6C_4A2D_4F6F_8035_0F50B05DBDCA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My parents’ relationship is on thin ice, but the air feels like it’s on fire. ⟪k:1⟫It’s much "
"too hot."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫お母さんとお父さんの仲は寒いけど、⟪k:1⟫天気は炎上。⟪k:2⟫暑過ぎ。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_9E8AA447_803D_4FF2_867B_0D87BF0DBCA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed14c9d99dc55e381ae171c50db18271d81568b8f7d6cb5d685de8bbdf6bc912
#. default-sha256: cdaebd43adae4a8a3b250ca3618801fcb055cfd0a7f391a4116bbf46b9393c9b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_9E8AA447_803D_4FF2_867B_0D87BF0DBCA8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My dad loves this seaside restaurant. ⟪k:1⟫It actually specializes in fish, but he always "
"asks for meat."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫お父さんは海沿いのレストランが大好き。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ほんとは魚料理がメインなんだけど、⟪k:3⟫決まっ"
"て肉料理を頼む。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_7568A884_1212_4814_AD60_5BB3B1D66CA4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c29a36affd6a1d71f2b0381d69fc62b628f58ff57671eda8f6eafd1f25082fca
#. default-sha256: 3b9ddf84ca593bae5ee8edb5219614e4450a146f3a39165f576f6afc38c515a8
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7568A884_1212_4814_AD60_5BB3B1D66CA4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though “always” isn’t very often. He’s out of the country most of the time, so we rarely eat "
"together as a family."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫とは言っても、⟪k:1⟫お父さんはほとんど外出してばかりで、⟪k:2⟫一家揃うことはあまりなかった。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_4714BF7B_C21A_4DE6_A54C_A5E914690614
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f2de887aa50031ea7ef9837d1d1952ffb602f592354a85d60ebb1ffd560158db
